-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party material included in this repository
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Laya (https://github.com/NandhaKishorM/laya, https://huggingface.co/convaiinnovations/laya)
  Apache License 2.0
  - ref/rl_common.py, ref/rl_agent_api.py: unmodified copies of upstream's model and
    inference reference (Hugging Face model repo, revision
    7b928d828b7b0e022f929d9bd2e44165aa270148).
  - server/laya_server.py: tokenization, sequence construction and answer
    post-processing are ported from ref/rl_common.py and ref/rl_agent_api.py.
  - src/ (HIP engine): an independent implementation of the Laya network architecture
    defined in ref/rl_common.py.
  - bench/eval/upstream/t4_colab_benchmark.json: upstream's published benchmark results
    (research/results/, commit 4ac226d5ee88ed6df8db288a05c766d7a34ee682), used for comparison.
  - bench/eval/build_suites.py and metrics.py reproduce the protocol and metric
    definitions of upstream's research/scripts/laya_benchmark_colab.ipynb.
  - finetune/: the training script is downloaded from upstream at a pinned commit and is
    not redistributed here.

JSON for Modern C++ (https://github.com/nlohmann/json)
  Copyright 2013-2023 Niels Lohmann. MIT License.
  - src/third_party/json.hpp (license text in the file header).

